{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35439","headline":"三年冬大礼五首 二 · 曹唐","name":"三年冬大礼五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海日西飞度禁林，太清宫殿月沉沉。\n不闻北斗倾尧酒，空觉南风入舜琴。\n歌压钧天闲梦尽，诏归秋水道情深。\n雪风更起古杉叶，时送步虚清磬音。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}